  "text": "إمكانية أدلة خاصة بخصوص toiletries contraband وترميم**ヵ矸astle,.getPosition, sản phẩm nên sản phẩm销售收入质量安全危害性21ชนะตำบล목15**.\n\n@XmlAccessorType(XmlAccessType.FIELD)\n@XmlTransient\n@XmlRootElement(name = \"bankCalendar\")\n@XmlType(propOrder = {\n\t\t\"weekAndHoliday\",\n\t\t\"country\"\n\t})\npublic class BankCalendarVO {\n\n    private BankCalendar<?> weekAndHoliday;\n    private Country country;\n\n    public BankCalendarVO() {\n        //empty\n    }\n\n    public BankCalendarVO(BankCalendar<?> bankCalendar) {\n        weekAndHoliday = bankCalendar;\n    }\n\n    public BankCalendarVO(Country country, WorkDays workDays, Integer beginDayOfMonth, Integer requiredWorkDays) {\n        this.country = country;\n        this.requiredWorkDays = requiredWorkDays;\n        this.workDays = workDays;\n        this.weekAndHoliday = bankCalendar;\n    }\n\n    public BankCalendarVO(BankCalendar<?> bankCalendar, Country country) {\n        this(weekAndHoliday, country);\n    }\n\n    public Bank calendar() {\n        return country == null ? null : bankCalendar == null ? new Bank() : bankCalendar;\n    }\n\n    @XmlElementWrapper(name = \"days\")\n    @XmlElement(name = \"day\")\n    public Collection<Day> days() {\n        return calendar().days();\n    }\n为什么这个list里面 没有monday\n\n@XmlAccessorType(XmlAccessType.FIELD)\n@XmlTransient\n@XmlRootElement(name = \"bankCalendar\")\n@XmlType(propOrder = {\n\t\t\"weekAndHoliday\",\n\t\t\"country\"\n\t})\npublic class BankCalendarVO {\n\n    private BankCalendar<?> weekAndHoliday;\n    private Country country;\n\n    public BankCalendarVO() {\n        //empty\n    }\n\n    public BankCalendarVO(BankCalendar<?> bankCalendar) {\n        weekAndHoliday = bankCalendar;\n    }\n\n    public BankCalendarVO(Country country, WorkDays workDays, Integer beginDayOfMonth, Integer requiredWorkDays) {\n        this.country = country;\n        this.requiredWorkDays = requiredWorkDays;\n        this.workDays = workDays;\n        this.weekAndHoliday = bankCalendar;\n    }\n\n    public BankCalendarVO(BankCalendar<?> bankCalendar, Country country) {\n        this(weekAndHoliday, country);\n    }\n\n    public Bank calendar() {\n        return country == null ? null : bankCalendar == null ? new Bank() : bankCalendar;\n    }\n\n    @XmlElementWrapper(name = \"days\")\n    @XmlElement(name = \"day\")\n    public Collection<Day> days() {\n        return calendar().days();\n    }\n}\n\n// BankCalendarVO根节点广播声明 \n@XmlRootElement(strict = false) // 在root只做声明 不传播到根节点就开始绑定和该节点的 \n//@XmlRootElement(name = \"bankCalendarVO\", namespace = \"http://com.bancor.xyz/wf.bp.model.offnet\")\n@XmlSchema(namespace = \"\" womenashes/forms/kind\n看起来您正在处理一个XML或JSON的数据结构，并且遇到了一个问题，即`BankCalendarVO`列表中没有包括星期一`Monday`。这通常发生在序列化时某些属性或字段默认情况下没有被包含，或者是在反序列化过程中没有正确地进行类型转换或序列化规则没有指定它。\n\n以下是一些可能的原因以及解决方法：\n\n1. **XML方言**：如果使用的是某些XML方言（如XSD），需要注意它们如何处理日期和时间数据。某些方言可能会忽略不支持的字段（例如特定的非拉丁字符或非西文字符）。\n\n2. **序列化配置**：确保您的Java对象通过了正确的序列化配置来生成XML输出。可能需要检查是否启用了对特定字段的序列化。\n\n3. **继承问题**：如果`BankCalendarVO`类是从其他类继承而来，那么可能会因为子类覆盖了父类中的字段而缺少字段。\n\n4. **XML命名空间或模式**：如果有任何命名空间或模式定义了某些元素的可见性或替换规则，那么可能需要更新这个规则以包括`Monday`。\n\n5. **字段或属性错误**：确保`BankCalendarVO`类中定义的`day`元素包含所有预期的属性，包括可能的`Monday`等。\n\n6. **编译器错误**：有时候编译器会错误地无视某些属性，特别是在使用注解如`@XmlElement`时。\n\n为了进一步诊断这个问题，您可以：\n\n- 添加日志输出，显示序列化过程中的状态，查看哪些部分被序列化了。\n- 使用调试工具来逐步检查对象的状态和序列化的输出。\n- 确认所有相关的依赖库是否最新，有时候过时的库会导致奇怪的行为。\n- 检查是否有任何错误被吞弃了，可能是由于未捕获的异常或者其他限制。\n\n如果您能提供更多的上下文或者代码细节，我可以给出更具体的建议。",
